{"annotations":[],"blockId":"bixiu-shang","blockTitle":"必修上","body":"声声慢[1]\n\n李清照\n\n寻寻觅觅，冷冷清清，凄凄惨惨戚戚[2]。乍暖还寒[3]时候，最难将息[4]。三杯两盏淡酒，怎敌他、晚来风急！雁过也，正伤心，却是旧时相识。\n\n满地黄花[5]堆积，憔悴损[6]，如今有谁堪[7]摘？守着窗儿，独自怎生得黑[8]！梧桐更兼细雨，到黄昏、点点滴滴。这次第[9]，怎一个愁字了得[10]！","contentVersion":"yw-3e77f0f7ffa5d042a6d06763","createdAt":"2024-08-21T12:03:49Z","derivedAuthor":"李清照","derivedFrom":"lesson-1706","excerpt":"声声慢 [24] \n李清照\n寻寻觅觅，冷冷清清，凄凄惨惨戚戚 [25] 。乍暖还寒 [26] 时候，最难将息 [27] 。三杯两盏淡酒，怎敌他、晚来风急！雁过也，正伤心，却是旧时相识。\n满地黄花 [28] 堆积，憔悴损 [29] ，如今有谁堪 [30] 摘？守着窗儿，独自怎生得黑 [31] ！梧桐更兼细雨，到黄昏、点点滴滴。这次第 [32] ，怎一个愁字了得 [33] ！","forumImages":[],"forumUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/t/topic/1706","id":"lesson-1706-p3","learningTasks":[],"postCount":1,"posts":[{"attachments":[],"created_at":"2024-08-21T12:03:49Z","id":"11138-3","images":[],"like_count":0,"links":[{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-1","text":"[1]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-2","text":"[2]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-3","text":"[3]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-4","text":"[4]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-5","text":"[5]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-6","text":"[6]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-7","text":"[7]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-8","text":"[8]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-9","text":"[9]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-10","text":"[10]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-11","text":"[11]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-12","text":"[12]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-13","text":"[13]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-14","text":"[14]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-15","text":"[15]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11138-16","text":"[16]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-111